 fix-missing-vidmode.patch

0ubuntu14 replaces the Unicode-licensed UTF conversion code with an ICU
implementation (LP: #2147049); 0ubuntu15 drops libboost-system-dev
(LP: #2166734). Our only change on top is the XF86VidMode fix from
0ubuntu13+unity1, unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
